# A run's raw output: results/<runId>/. Ignored until a run is published;
# results/README.md states where a published run goes and what it must meet.
results/*
!results/README.md
!results/published/
# Each arm's build output (dist/ and node_modules/ are ignored at the repo root).
arms/svelte/build/
arms/svelte/.svelte-kit/
.scratch/
